You're Registered!

Hi <%= @tickets.first.attendee_name %>,

Your <%= @tickets.one? ? 'registration is' : 'registrations are' %> confirmed. Here are your ticket details:

Event: <%= @event.title %>
Date: <%= @event.start_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
<% if @event.event_locations.any? %>
Venue: <%= @event.event_locations.first.name %>
<% end %>

<% @tickets.each_with_index do |ticket, index| %>
Ticket <%= index + 1 %>
Ticket Type: <%= ticket.ticket_type.name %>
Name: <%= ticket.attendee_name %>
Your Ticket ID: <%= ticket.public_id %>

<% ticket_payment = ticket.ticket_payment %>
<% amount_paid = (ticket_payment&.amount || ticket.ticket_type.current_price).to_f %>
<% if ticket.paid? && amount_paid.positive? %>
Payment Receipt
- Receipt No: <%= ticket.public_id %>
- Payment Status: Paid
<% if ticket_payment&.paid_at.present? %>- Payment Date: <%= ticket_payment.paid_at.in_time_zone.strftime("%B %d, %Y %I:%M %p %Z") %>
<% end %>- Amount Paid: <%= (ticket_payment&.currency.presence || 'MYR') %> <%= format('%.2f', (ticket_payment&.amount || ticket.ticket_type.current_price).to_f) %>
<% if ticket_payment&.gateway_payment_id.presence %>- Transaction ID: <%= ticket_payment.gateway_payment_id %>
<% end %><% if ticket_payment&.gateway_response&.dig('order_id').presence %>- Order ID: <%= ticket_payment.gateway_response['order_id'] %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
Please show the relevant ticket ID or attached QR code at check-in.

<% if @contact_email.present? %>
Should you have any questions, please reach out to us at <%= @contact_email %>.
<% end %>
See you at the event!

Warm regards,
<%= @sender_name %>

